d with solid as well as hollow pagodas and also with monastic establishments."<br>"According to tradition, in 1057, Aniruddha ... conquered the southern Mon center of Thaton and brought back with him the Pali scriptures of Theravada Buddhism, a large number of Buddhist monks, and scores of artists and craftsmen, thereby initiating more than two centuries of building activity at Pagan."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2801, 'temperature': 0.2})
